# Picture output. PDF page 8, printed page 6, block P.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
# A8.4/P999 has a 6.8 capacitor: analog startup boundary input.
chip A10 74166
chip A11 74166
chip B10 74166
chip B11 74166
chip C10 74166
chip C11 74166
chip D10 74166
chip D11 74166
chip E10 74166
chip E11 74166
chip A8 7404
chip A9 7437
chip B9 7408
chip C9 7400
chip E9 7408
chip H13 7432
chip D9 7430
chip F5 7400

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net PLVA A10.1 A11.13
net KD08 A10.2 B10.2 C10.2 D10.2 E10.2
net KD09 A10.3 B10.3 C10.3 D10.3 E10.3
net KD10 A10.4 B10.4 C10.4 D10.4 E10.4
net KD11 A10.5 B10.5 C10.5 D10.5 E10.5
net GND A10.6 A11.1 A11.6 B11.1 C11.1 D11.1 E11.1
net 6PQ07 A10.7 A11.7 B10.7 B11.7 C10.7 C11.7 D10.7 D11.7 E10.7 E11.7 A9.6
net P999 A10.9 A11.9 B10.9 B11.9 C10.9 C11.9 D10.9 D11.9
net KD12 A10.10 B10.10 C10.10 D10.10 E10.10
net KD13 A10.11 B10.11 C10.11 D10.11 E10.11
net KD14 A10.12 B10.12 C10.12 D10.12 E10.12
net PLVD A10.13 A8.1
net KD15 A10.14 B10.14 C10.14 D10.14 E10.14
net 5LCEN A10.15 A11.15
net KD00 A11.2 B11.2 C11.2 D11.2 E11.2
net KD01 A11.3 B11.3 C11.3 D11.3 E11.3
net KD02 A11.4 B11.4 C11.4 D11.4 E11.4
net KD03 A11.5 B11.5 C11.5 D11.5 E11.5
net KD04 A11.10 B11.10 C11.10 D11.10 E11.10
net KD05 A11.11 B11.11 C11.11 D11.11 E11.11
net KD06 A11.12 B11.12 C11.12 D11.12 E11.12
net KD07 A11.14 B11.14 C11.14 D11.14 E11.14
net PBVA B10.1 B11.13
net 5PBVE B10.6 B11.6 B9.3
net PBVC B10.13 C9.2
net 5KVLB B10.15 B11.15 B9.2
net PMVA C10.1 C11.13
net 5PMVE C10.6 C11.6 B9.6
net PMVC C10.13 C9.9 E9.13
net 5KVLM C10.15 C11.15 B9.5
net PDVA D10.1 D11.13
net 5PDVE D10.6 D11.6 B9.8
net PDVC D10.13 C9.5
net 5KVLD D10.15 D11.15 B9.9
net PNVA E10.1 E11.13
net 5PNVE E10.6 E11.6 B9.11
net P2PL E10.9 E11.9 H13.11
net PNVC E10.13 C9.12 E9.1
net 5KVLN E10.15 E11.15 B9.12
net 5PLVD A8.2 D9.11
net 1PQ07 A9.3
net 5TQ07 A9.1 A9.2
net 1TQ07 A9.4 A9.5
net 2PQ07 A9.8
net 6TQ07 A9.9 A9.10
net 5BDGC B9.1
net 5MECG B9.4
net 5DDGC B9.10
net 5NECG B9.13
net 5PBVD C9.3 D9.12
net 1BDGC C9.1
net 5PDVD C9.6 D9.6
